### glob with extension against a one character class
[[ *.txt == [abc] ]] && echo "never"
>>> SC2193 1:10
>>> SC2203 1:4

### tilde user against tilde plus is fine
[[ ~alice == ~+ ]] && echo "home"
>>> none

### bare tilde against tilde plus is fine
[[ ~ == ~+ ]] && echo "home"
>>> none

### tilde path against the same text quoted is fine
[[ ~/bin == "~/bin" ]] && echo "same"
>>> SC2088 1:14
